/*
 * rescarddll (Card Party results): types, cross-unit globals and prototypes shared by its units
 * (rescard, object, stage).
 *
 * Generated by gen_skel.py; names are the reference symbol map's. Offsets are GameCube ones from
 * build/mp5-asm/rescarddll. Types and pinned prototypes: fork S (2026-10-01). Type names are the
 * md* twins' (mdoptionDll.h / mdbeachDll.h / mdpartyDll.h) where the reference shows the same
 * layout; SYS and the work sizes are measured from every sys->/sysP-> access and ObjectSetup's
 * HuMemDirectMallocNum sizes. Fields without a certain meaning are named by offset.
 */

